<mxCell id="c3" value="Khu vuc chinh co kich thuoc co dinh AxB (vi du 3a x 4b). Moi o Agent co kich thuoc toi thieu la a x b.
Cang chon nhieu Agent, o cang scale nho dan nhung KHONG nho hon a x b. Khi day 1 hang (~2-3 o), tu dong xuong hang moi va cuon doc." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#64748B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="54" width="1300" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
