<mxCell id="c27" value="Tu 6 Agent tro len: giu nguyen kich thuoc toi thieu a x b, xep them hang va cho phep cuon doc (scroll) trong khu vuc chinh." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;spacing=6;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#F59E0B;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="130" width="660" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c28" value="Ap dung cho: Live Screen (thumbnail fps thap khi nhieu Agent, 24fps that khi Focus 1 Agent),
Webcam (tai su dung cung 1 co che voi Live Screen),
Keylogger (moi o la 1 panel log rieng cho tung Agent, cung quy tac scale kich thuoc va xep hang).

Rieng Application/Process dung dang bang (khong can scale o) vi da co cot 'Agent' de phan biet.
File Tab dung bo chuyen Agent (tab ngang) thay vi luoi, vi thao tac file can tuong tac sau tren tung may.
Power Tab dung chung 1 bang dieu khien cho danh sach Agent dang chon (khong can scale o)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#64748B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="175" width="660" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="page6" name="06 - Screen Tab - Focus 1 Agent (24fps)"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="800" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1440" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=0;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;spacing=6;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="220" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
